WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:01.466
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:00:02.504 --> 00:00:05.281
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> The match will be over at about 5.30.

00:00:07.253 --> 00:00:08.154
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 11

00:00:09.037 --> 00:00:13.792
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> My alarm goes off at six o’clock every morning.

00:00:15.707 --> 00:00:16.721
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 15

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:21.117
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We set off for the airport at 6.30.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:23.842
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.910
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I want to give up chocolate.

00:00:29.117 --> 00:00:29.889
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:33.026
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Don’t throw away that letter!

00:00:34.972 --> 00:00:35.758
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:00:36.722 --> 00:00:39.875
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Turn down the music! It’s very loud.

00:00:41.848 --> 00:00:42.799
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:43.691 --> 00:00:47.929
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Turn up the TV! I can’t hear.

00:00:50.035 --> 00:00:50.834
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:54.013
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> He looked up the words in a dictionary.

00:00:56.003 --> 00:00:56.786
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:57.654 --> 00:00:59.370
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Could you fill in this form?

00:01:01.278 --> 00:01:02.295
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 13

00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:06.432
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I want to find out about hotels in Madrid.

00:01:08.465 --> 00:01:09.175
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:10.288 --> 00:01:13.535
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> It’s bedtime – go and put on your pyjamas.

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:16.260
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 12

00:01:17.288 --> 00:01:20.155
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Could you take off your boots, please?

00:01:22.268 --> 00:01:23.100
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:01:24.091 --> 00:01:27.317
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> My sister’s looking after Jimmy for me today.

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.170
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:01:31.177 --> 00:01:33.806
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m really looking forward to the holidays.

00:01:35.894 --> 00:01:36.947
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 14

00:01:37.939 --> 00:01:40.233
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> She works out every morning.